      "sourceText": "| 关键字 | 含义 | 典型场景 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `constexpr` | 可以在编译期求值，也可以在运行期调用 | 通用编译期函数、常量表达式 |\n| `consteval` | 必须在编译期求值 | 生成编译期 ID、编译期校验 |\n| `constinit` | 保证静态对象在编译期初始化，但对象不一定是 const | 避免全局变量动态初始化顺序问题 |",
      "translatedText": "| Keyword | Meaning | Typical Scenario |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `constexpr` | Can be evaluated at compile time or called at runtime | General compile\\-time functions, constant expressions |\n| `consteval` | Must be evaluated at compile time | Generate compile\\-time IDs, compile\\-time validation |\n| `constinit` | Ensures static objects are initialized at compile time, but the object is not necessarily const | Avoid dynamic initialization order issues for global variables |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 191,
        "outputTokens": 76,
        "costUsd": 0.000149
      }
